### Draws the current kept event of /vis/reviewKeptEvents twice (used by vis_tridents.mac): oblique
### view, then side view; with TSG_OFFSCREEN every rebuild writes the next PNG file
/vis/viewer/set/viewpointThetaPhi 60 30 deg
/vis/viewer/rebuild
/vis/viewer/set/viewpointThetaPhi 90 0.1 deg
/vis/viewer/rebuild
